# CLAUDE.md — app/Support (security-relevant helpers)

Small on purpose: every file here is a security or API-shape boundary, never casual utility code. A helper with a
domain meaning belongs in a service.

Create each when first needed, in this shape:

- **`Redaction`**: the ONE list of secret-bearing key patterns, for logging and any persisted payload snapshot.
- **The HMAC signer/verifier**: one implementation with a constant-time comparison (`hash_equals`), used by the
  middleware and by any client that signs outbound calls.
<!-- if:htmx -->
- **`Markdown::render()`**: `Str::markdown` with raw HTML escaped (`html_input: escape`), unsafe links
  (`javascript:` and co.) dropped, nesting capped at 100. It is the **only** output allowed through `{!! !!}` in Blade
<!-- if:islands -->
  or `{@html}` in an island
<!-- endif -->
  (`app/CLAUDE.md`). Loosening an option is a security change.
<!-- endif -->
<!-- if:spa -->
- **`Markdown::render()`**: `Str::markdown` with raw HTML escaped (`html_input: escape`), unsafe links
  (`javascript:` and co.) dropped, nesting capped at 100. It is the **only** output allowed through `{@html}` in the
  SvelteKit app (`app/CLAUDE.md`). Loosening an option is a security change.
<!-- endif -->
<!-- if:tenancy -->
- **`CurrentTenant`**: the one holder of the current tenant, bound `scoped()` (root `CLAUDE.md`, Tenancy). Its
  methods are static and read that instance:
  - `id()` throws when no tenant is set; `check()` reports whether one is;
  - `set(?string $id)` sets the holder and `app.tenant_id` on the default connection (`''` for null), never Context.
    Where it may run: `app/CLAUDE.md` (Octane);
  - `run(string $id, Closure $work)` sets the holder, the connection and hidden Context, and restores all three in
    `finally`.
<!-- endif -->

Rules:

- Nothing here reaches the network or the filesystem.
- Pure and stateless, so safe under Octane. No static caches.
<!-- if:tenancy -->
  The one exception is `CurrentTenant`, safe because it is `scoped()`; nothing else stores the tenant.
<!-- endif -->
- Every surface uses this code: a change here has the widest blast radius.
<!-- house:end -->
